  {
   "id": "concept1",
   "type": "concept",
   "title": {
    "en": "Cytoskeleton, cilia, flagella and centrioles"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "The cytoskeleton is a network of microtubules, microfilaments and intermediate filaments that gives mechanical support, helps motility and maintains cell shape. Cilia (small, oar-like) and eukaryotic flagella (longer, wave-like) are covered by the plasma membrane; their core, the axoneme, has nine doublets of peripheral microtubules and a pair of central microtubules (the 9+2 array), joined by radial spokes. They arise from basal bodies. The centrosome has two cylindrical centrioles lying perpendicular to each other; each has a cartwheel of nine evenly spaced peripheral triplets of tubulin with a central proteinaceous hub. Centrioles form the basal bodies of cilia and flagella and the spindle apparatus in animal cells."
   },
   "points": [
    {
     "en": "Axoneme: 9 doublets + 2 central singlets (9+2)."
    },
    {
     "en": "Centriole: 9 triplets, no central microtubules (9+0)."
    },
    {
     "en": "Eukaryotic flagella differ in structure from prokaryotic flagella."
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "The cytoskeleton is a network of microtubules, microfilaments and intermediate filaments that gives mechanical support, helps motility and maintains cell shape. Cilia (small, oar-like) and eukaryotic flagella (longer, wave-like) are covered by the plasma membrane; their core, the axoneme, has nine doublets of peripheral microtubules and a pair of central microtubules (the 9+2 array), joined by radial spokes. They arise from basal bodies. The centrosome has two cylindrical centrioles lying perpendicular to each other; each has a cartwheel of nine evenly spaced peripheral triplets of tubulin with a central proteinaceous hub. Centrioles form the basal bodies of cilia and flagella and the spindle apparatus in animal cells.",
    "kn": "ಕೋಶಾಸ್ಥಿಪಂಜರವು ಸೂಕ್ಷ್ಮನಳಿಕೆಗಳು ಮತ್ತು ಸೂಕ್ಷ್ಮತಂತುಗಳ ಜಾಲ. ಸೀಲಿಯಾ ಮತ್ತು ಕಶಾಂಗಗಳ ಅಕ್ಷತಂತು 9+2 ರಚನೆ ಹೊಂದಿದೆ. ಸೆಂಟ್ರಿಯೋಲ್‌ನಲ್ಲಿ ಒಂಬತ್ತು ತ್ರಿವಳಿ ಸೂಕ್ಷ್ಮನಳಿಕೆಗಳಿವೆ."
   }
  },
