  {
   "id": "concept2",
   "type": "concept",
   "title": {
    "en": "Nucleus, chromosomes and microbodies"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "Robert Brown described the nucleus in 1831; Flemming named its stainable material chromatin. The interphase nucleus has loose chromatin, a nuclear matrix and one or more nucleoli, which are sites of active ribosomal RNA synthesis. The nuclear envelope has two membranes with a 10–50 nm perinuclear space and is pierced by nuclear pores. Mature mammalian RBCs and sieve tube cells of vascular plants lack a nucleus. During division chromatin condenses into chromosomes; each has a centromere bearing disc-shaped kinetochores. By centromere position chromosomes are metacentric (middle), sub-metacentric (slightly away), acrocentric (near the end) and telocentric (terminal). Microbodies are minute membrane-bound vesicles with enzymes, present in both plant and animal cells."
   },
   "points": [
    {
     "en": "Nucleolus: site of rRNA synthesis, not membrane-bound."
    },
    {
     "en": "Some chromosomes have a satellite at a secondary constriction."
    },
    {
     "en": "Metacentric chromosomes have two equal arms."
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "Robert Brown described the nucleus in 1831; Flemming named its stainable material chromatin. The interphase nucleus has loose chromatin, a nuclear matrix and one or more nucleoli, which are sites of active ribosomal RNA synthesis. The nuclear envelope has two membranes with a 10–50 nm perinuclear space and is pierced by nuclear pores. Mature mammalian RBCs and sieve tube cells of vascular plants lack a nucleus. During division chromatin condenses into chromosomes; each has a centromere bearing disc-shaped kinetochores. By centromere position chromosomes are metacentric (middle), sub-metacentric (slightly away), acrocentric (near the end) and telocentric (terminal). Microbodies are minute membrane-bound vesicles with enzymes, present in both plant and animal cells.",
    "kn": "ಕೋಶಕೇಂದ್ರವನ್ನು ರಾಬರ್ಟ್ ಬ್ರೌನ್ ವಿವರಿಸಿದರು. ಕೋಶಕೇಂದ್ರ ಕವಚಕ್ಕೆ ಎರಡು ಪೊರೆ ಮತ್ತು ರಂಧ್ರಗಳಿವೆ. ನ್ಯೂಕ್ಲಿಯೋಲಸ್ rRNA ತಯಾರಿಕೆಯ ಸ್ಥಳ. ಸೆಂಟ್ರೋಮಿಯರ್ ಸ್ಥಾನದ ಆಧಾರದ ಮೇಲೆ ವರ್ಣತಂತುಗಳು ನಾಲ್ಕು ವಿಧ."
   }
  },
